> what is 20 percent of 150?
  ucas: 150*20/100
30
> what is 15 percent of x?
  ucas: it(x) = x*15/100
  ucas: show it
it(x: real) = 15x/100
  -> real
> what is 100 percent of 7?
  ucas: 7*100/100
7
> what is 0 percent of 99?
  ucas: 99*0/100
0
> what is 33 percent of 33?
  ucas: 33*33/100
10.89
> what is 7 percent of 1000?
  ucas: 1000*7/100
70
> what is 15% of x?
  ucas: it(x) = x*15/100
  ucas: show it
it(x: real) = 15x/100
  -> real
